                                                "sense_id": "31c6a49e-2e2a-3cd1-a7ed-ba8cef1d2c92",
                                                "text": "The fourth field is also party per pale, and for the dutchy of Genevois, contains chequered Or and azure: The sinister for the dutchy of Montserat, a target, gules. The point Or is a black eagle of the county of Maurienne."
                                            }
